# lcm(a, b) = (a / g) b: for b not 0, g is not 0 and a / g = k1 where
# a = k1 g, so lcm = k1 b = k2 a; a common multiple m not 0 has a b
# dividing m a and m b, so gcd(m a, m b) = m g, and a b = lcm g

